43b9f19b535d62b360fa2bc199985 builder-block cs-rte-text"><div class=3D"buil=
der-text" style=3D"outline: none;"><div><p>An <strong>IT incident</strong> =
is any unplanned interruption or reduction in the quality of an IT service.=
 Incidents range from minor issues, such as a slow application, to critical=
 disruptions, including server outages. Incident management aims to handle =
these incidents effectively, ensuring IT services are restored promptly.</p=
