lock cs-rte-text"><div class=3D"builder-text" style=3D"outline: none;"><div=
><div><strong>Incident management</strong> is the structured process of det=
ecting, responding to, and resolving incidents that disrupt IT services. It=
 involves coordinating people, processes, and tools to ensure rapid resolut=
ion and minimal impact on business operations. Unlike problem management, w=
hich addresses root causes, incident management focuses solely on restoring=
